    "Text": "Project history excludes secrets and automatic operational audit. This does NOT make audit local-only: every host retains permanent local audit and an append-only outbox delivers sanitized records to the hub unversioned ledger independently of project commits. AuditRecord key=(OriginNodeId,RecordId UUID); fields ProjectId,EntityKind,EntityId,OriginSequence int64,OccurredUtc,Actor,Action,PayloadVersion,PayloadHash,Payload. POST audit/batches validates token/project, inserts atomically by key and returns per-record durable receipts. Same key/hash is already_received; same key/different hash=409 audit_id_conflict. No UPDATE/DELETE permission. Local pruning is forbidden. Migration backfills TODO and generic audit history with counts/hashes and receipts. Credential values are excluded at capture, not silently replicated."
